# Ignore everything by default; only .tex/.pdf sources and this config are tracked.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!travis_resume.tex
!travis_resume.pdf
!web_resume.tex
!web_resume.pdf
!.github
!.github/**

# Company-specific resume variants (cv/<company>/<role-slug>/) are kept local
# only — already covered by the top-level "*" rule above, nothing to allowlist.
